# contexts, each 8-byte aligned (MS-SMB2 2.2.3.1), two of types with a struct
# and two kept as bytes. Positions count from the SMB2 header's first byte,
# as the offsets do. Multi-byte fields are little-endian (MS-SMB2 2.2).
